        (true ==> ={RO.h}) (x{1} = R_find0.x0{2} ==> forall (x2 : X), RO.h{1} x2 = if ! BFO1.h{2} x2 /\ x2 <> R_find0.x0{2} then R_find0.gy{2} x2 else R_find0.y0{2}); 1,2: by smt().
